  "notes": "Requires a connected headless or real player and a fresh isolated arena. Four bosses and repeated sampling bound the random idle-look control. Start tick-frozen, with all four chunks loaded. Bedrock floor and ten-tick position/velocity resets prevent flight and NoGravity drift from moving bosses away from the player. No whole-fight or rendering assertion. Spawn observation stays inside invulnerability and does not reach the explosion. Direct packet assertion: record ClientboundAddEntityPacket IDs for WITHER and inspect their ClientboundRotateHeadPacket headYaw during these 180 ticks. Spawn-window case requires no nonzero headYaw; active control requires at least one. Command observations verify arena and timer controls only. Pitch is a separate field and is not the head-yaw oracle."
